{"about_the_game":"You are Fiona, sorceress and captain of the Zaftig-25. Below is a world of weird things. <br><br>Rumors speak of a great treasure hidden somewhere along the coasts of Aesoph. <br><br>Will you be able to collect the three magical tomes needed to unlock the ancient cavern?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/Cat_01.gif?t=1741548069\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A fun physics based player controller.<br></li><li> Numerous spells, including the ability to shapeshift into a raven.<br></li><li> Magical items, and an inventory to manage them.<br></li><li> Music and stories to listen to while playing.</li></ul><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/Birb_01.gif?t=1741548069\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><br>Although Catsploration is a solo indie game, the project depends on the works of many developers and artists. Please see  for a full list of creators!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Join Our Discord!</h2><br>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1710260?t=1741548069","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1710260?t=1741548069","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741548069","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741548069","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2163570,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"You are Fiona, sorceress and captain of the Zaftig-25. Below is a world of weird things. <br><br>Rumors speak of a great